      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Manual Controls are on, so this choice is not used now." : {
      "comment" : "First row of the Fast Shutter page in Settings while nope.'s Manual Controls are on: the choice is kept, but not used until Manual Controls are off. Manual Controls is the name of nope.'s button; use its translation. Must not claim more than the English. Draft wording for the Honesty review (docs/design/SETTING-SCOPE.md). Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Manifest SHA-256" : {
