      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "New photos include where they were taken: latitude, longitude and altitude. You can turn Location off under Details in Each Photo in Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of the Location On chip on the camera: new photos include their location. Details in Each Photo is the name of nope.'s own settings page; use its translation. Must not claim more than the English. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "No contrast curve, and no noise reduction, sharpening or local tone mapping." : {
      "comment" : "In the photo details, under a copy developed with the Flat look: what the look does. The same claims as the processing note. Draft wording for the Honesty review.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "No contrast curve: closest to the sensor, so it looks flat and low in contrast." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the Flat look. Must not claim more than the English. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "No Data Collected" : {
      "comment" : "Honesty heading: the app collects no data. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "No location in the files" : {
      "comment" : "Summary line in the photo details: the saved files hold no location. Draft wording for the Honesty review.",
