      "comment" : "Honesty heading: the app never goes online. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "No optional details in the files" : {
      "comment" : "Summary line in the photo details: the saved files hold none of the optional details (date, camera, lens and so on). Draft wording for the Honesty review.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "No Preview" : {
      "comment" : "Title in the Last Photo viewer of the camera opened from the Lock Screen: it makes no previews, so only the photo's small thumbnail is shown. Honesty wording: must not claim more than the English. Draft for the Honesty review.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
